/// One editable ink annotation stored as a transparent anchored PNG.
///
/// The optional vector payload is carried in `wp:docPr@descr`, matching
/// GenOffice's v1 format. Jade intentionally treats it as opaque JSON so hosts
/// can evolve their stroke model without an OOXML migration.
